      <h2 class="paragraph__header phighlight__heading">
        <div class="phighlight__heading-main">Programs</div>
        <span class="styled">that matter</span>
      </h2>
              <div class="phighlight__intro-cta-wrapper">
                      <div class="paragraph__intro phighlight__intro">
              <p>Transfer anywhere. Get a high-paying job in two years or less. Pick from more than 75 program options. Find the track that’s best for you — and let’s get to work.</p>
            </div>
                                <div class="phighlight__cta">
              <a href="/degrees-programs">Explore Degrees &amp; Programs</a>
            </div>
                  </div>
          </div>
    <div class="phighlight__cards info__cards-wrapper">
      
      <div class="field field--name-field-ph-card field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">



  <div class="paragraph info__card phighlight__card paragraph--type--prog-highlight-card paragraph--view-mode--default" data-aos="fade-left">
    
      <div class="info__card-top-wrapper">
        <div class="phighlight__card-image info__card-image">
          <div class="media media--type-image media--view-mode-programs-highlight-card">
        
  <div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden">
              <div class="field__item">    <picture>
                  <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/programs_highlight_card_lg/public/uploads/img/2024-03/AutoBody2023-46.jpg?h=45fe86a3&amp;itok=RxPad7CL 1x" media="(min-width: 1025px)" type="image/jpeg" width="648" height="661"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/programs_highlight_card_md/public/uploads/img/2024-03/AutoBody2023-46.jpg?h=45fe86a3&amp;itok=YqC3QjTV 1x" media="(min-width: 700px)" type="image/jpeg" width="575" height="577"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/programs_highlight_card/public/uploads/img/2024-03/AutoBody2023-46.jpg?h=45fe86a3&amp;itok=V4PdrlZC 1x" type="image/jpeg" width="270" height="399"/>
                  <img loading="eager" width="575" height="577" src="/sites/default/files/styles/programs_highlight_card_md/public/uploads/img/2024-03/AutoBody2023-46.jpg?h=45fe86a3&amp;itok=YqC3QjTV" alt="student with spray paint gun working on car bumper in paint booth" typeof="foaf:Image" />

  </picture>

</div>
          </div>

  </div>

        </div>
        <div class="info__card-top phighlight__card-top">
          <div class="phighlight__card-prog--name info__card-subtitle">Auto Body Collision Technology</div>
          <div class="phighlight__card-close--content">
            <h3 class="phighlight__card-title info__card-name">You&#039;ve Got Options</h3>
            <div class="phighlight__card-prog--type">
      <div class="field field--name-field-sel-prog-type field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">Diploma</div>
          </div>
  </div>
          </div>
          <div class="phighlight__card-cta"><a href="/auto-body-collision-technology" hreflang="en">Auto Body Collision Technology</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="info__card-text">
        <div class="info__card-text-wrapper">
          <div class="phighlight__card-summary">
            With an updated degree option designed to get you in the career force more quickly, our Auto Body program gets you ready for nonstructural and structural auto repairs, as well as using your artistic capabilities with paint guns.
          </div>
          <div class="phighlight__card-vid-quote-wrapper">
            <div class="phighlight__card-video video video--inline">
              <div class="video__wrapper">
                <div class="video__cover">
                  <div class="media media--type-image media--view-mode-programs-highlight-video">
        
  <div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden">
              <div class="field__item">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/programs_highlight_video/public/uploads/img/2023-05/jon.png?h=b732d0f5&amp;itok=xkcv8Sle" width="699" height="484" alt="Jon headshot" typeof="foaf:Image" class="image-style-programs-highlight-video" />


</div>
          </div>

  </div>

                                  </div>
                               </div>
            </div>
            <div class="phighlight__card-quote-wrapper">
              <div class="phighlight__card-quote">I always loved working on cars, and I wanted to have the mechanical abilities. I’ve got family members who are into working on fast muscle cars, and this is where I want to be. </div>
              <div class="phighlight__card-quote--name">Jon Osborn</div>
              <div class="phighlight__card-quote-attribution">
                <a href="/auto-body-collision-technology">
                  Auto Body Collision Technology
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
