          <div class="phighlight__card-cta"><a href="/degrees-programs/associate-arts" hreflang="en">Associate of Arts</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="info__card-text">
        <div class="info__card-text-wrapper">
          <div class="phighlight__card-summary">
            If you want to save money AND take advantage of small class sizes, SCTCC is the best place to start your bachelor&#039;s degree. Not only do we offer an AA, but you have Transfer Pathway options to customize your transfer. 
          </div>
          <div class="phighlight__card-vid-quote-wrapper">
            <div class="phighlight__card-video video video--inline">
              <div class="video__wrapper">
                <div class="video__cover">
                  <div class="media media--type-image media--view-mode-programs-highlight-video">
        
  <div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden">
              <div class="field__item">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/programs_highlight_video/public/uploads/img/2023-04/adric.png?h=ea64f5da&amp;itok=suCo5fNG" width="699" height="484" alt="Adric Headshot" typeof="foaf:Image" class="image-style-programs-highlight-video" />


</div>
          </div>

  </div>

                                  </div>
                               </div>
            </div>
            <div class="phighlight__card-quote-wrapper">
              <div class="phighlight__card-quote">I&#039;m getting an AA, and I know classes are transferable. Plus they&#039;re much cheaper on this side. You can take an identical course for half the price and it&#039;s the same class. The small classes are outstanding: you get a lot more one-on-one.</div>
              <div class="phighlight__card-quote--name">Adric Waibel</div>
              <div class="phighlight__card-quote-attribution">
                <a href="/aa">
                  Liberal Arts &amp; Transfer
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
