      <div class="info__card-text">
        <div class="info__card-text-wrapper">
          <div class="phighlight__card-summary">
            Take your passion for food to the next level with a degree from SCTCC&#039;s Culinary Arts program. With food presentation, nutrition, sanitation, and safe equipment operation, Culinary Arts will let you have fun in the kitchen for success in your career.
